Z||000012||stimpy||11-26-2000||11:14 PM||||Oklahoma is just like that. Buckle o' the Bible belt. Now, it's not illegal to <B>have</B> a tattoo, (otherwise an even larger percentage of the population would be incarcerated) but it is illegal to give a tattoo. That is why there are tattoo parlors on the border of every neighboring state.  You gotta really want a tattoo.||||reg||1
